        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/b9bd4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-30T00:06:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Tsunami (and most other threshold effects) just add additional stuff to what that (single) use of the Power Card does. Perhaps in the target land, perhaps in other lands - there are a number which can have effects outside of the target land, like Vengeance of the Dead or The Trees and Stones Speak of War. No ambiguity there.</p><p>And that's how I'd originally also been thinking of the&nbsp;<strong>Repeat</strong> instructions... but after more careful consideration I think&nbsp;<strong>Repeat</strong>s need to be considered a separate effect.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
