        "created_at": "2017-07-30T01:35:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We've got a power that came up on Thursday night's game - and I can't think of what it was right now - that added blight, then possibly dealt damage based on blight present if the elemental kickers were met. Is this something that would count the blight added by the power in calculating the damage?</p>",
