        "created_at": "2017-07-30T02:08:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>@jffdougan: Yes. You follow the instructions in order, and \"Add a Blight\" happens before \"Per Blight, [damage and fear bonus]\".</p><p>EDIT: Ninja'd. And <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8q3\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">FAQ Entry added</a>.</p>",
