        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-30T06:12:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah, why not turn this into a question section for good old Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instruments of their own Destruction came up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bringer cannot deal damage, and it spells out that if they would cause Dahan to deal damage that damage is also not real. However, Instruments causes the Invaders to deal damage to themselves. This edge case isn't covered. Is this damage false damage as well, or since it is the invaders dealing the damage is it allowed by Dreaming of a thousand deaths?</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:28:45.903Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
