        "created_at": "2017-08-01T03:01:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And the extra ravage caused by Manifest Incarnation works as normal.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I believe that's correct. It's an extra Invader Action, as per the rules in the Branch &amp; Claw rulebook, and can be prevented by A Year of Perfect Stillness, for instance.</p>",
